        prompts: {
          human: "Your team has a run of 5♠ 6♠ 7♠ 8♠ 9♠ — two more cards and it's a clean biriba (500 pts)! You draw 10♠ from the stock. Do you add it to the run (now 6 cards, need one more) or hold it, hoping for 4♠ as well to maximize your options?",
          ai: "Game: Biriba. Greek rummy. 108 cards (2×52 + 4 Jokers). 4 players in partnerships. Meld sets and runs. Jokers/2s are wild. Complete a 'biriba' (7+ card meld) to go out. Clean biriba=500, dirty=300. Going out=100. Cards in hand are penalties. Play anti-clockwise. Target score: 2500 or 5000.",
